ultaneously  and out of order which has led to her  occasionally confusing which scene  belongs to which movie while the final  scene that was shot was actually one for  the second movie king's last scene was  with her on-screen bff joel courtney it  was the scene where joel and i are  having that really heart-to-heart with  him about the collagen honestly we can't  think of a better final scene for the  tuta film especially since it was their  friendship that started it all  let's do it  megan young revealed that she actually  had a morning ritual on set of the  kissing booth sequels by bringing  morning oats for breakfast young's  co-stars took note of her daily  breakfast routine and soon enough stars  like taylor zakar perez and joey king  were bringing their own morning oats to  set  you could say the young was a  trendsetter on set kissing booth was  that experience that like once in a  lifetime kind of experience  jacob allordy has revealed that over the  course of the past three movies there  has been less and less kissing in each  subsequent film  this makes sense as the third  installment is the only film of the  trilogy not to feature the titular  attraction fear not though as elordi  assured fans that there's still plenty  of kissing in the film well that's a  relief  while filming the mario kart sequence in  the third film joey king's mother and  boyfriend were sitting right behind the  camera watching her and joel courtney  face off king revealed that she often  brings the popular nintendo racing game  to various film and television sets and  that she did bring it with her while  filming the kissing booth movies  honestly who wouldn't want to face joey  king off in mario kart what are you  doing  winning  the former queen of teen movies molly  ringwald has of course played the role  of mrs flynn in all three kissing booth  movies much like how elle forms a strong  connection with mrs flynn joey king  formed a friendship with the iconic 80s  star hugging her was just as you would  you'd expect so warm and wonderful king  has stated that getting to hug ringwald  for a scene in the third film was a  definite highlight but as a person i  feel so lucky to have gotten to know her  joey king is clearly living the dream  from getting to meet famous icons like  ringwald as well as getting to kiss not  only jacob allordy but also taylor zakar  perez  regardless of the project jacob allordy  has always been committed to the  characters he plays on screen much like  he did with other roles ilordi wrote a  journal through the eyes of noah in  order to prepare himself for all three  films  maybe lordy will become the next great  method actor alongside leonardo dicaprio  and joaquin phoenix  nice  despite its southern california setting  the kissing booth 3 was actually filmed  in south africa much like the first two  films the cast and crew have revealed  that during filming they've encountered  plenty of situations that wouldn't be  considered normal occurrences in  california  including dealing with monkeys who would  constantly steal things from the set  sounds like trouble  while joey king and jacob belordy's  relationship may not have lasted king  did form a close friendship with joel  courtney  courtney revealed that his chemistry in  bond with king on screen was entirely  effortless comparing it to putting on  your favorite jacket it slips right on  you and you know exactly how to wear it  hopefully we'll get to see king and  courtney starr together in more films  together in the future at least the  press tour gave us a couple more cute  moments between the two hey there i'm  jill courtney and i am joey king  many fans believed that jacob allordy  was miserable on set of the sequels  since he was having to work with his  ex-girlfriend joey king he has gone on  to deny those rumors and claims that he  just has a resting miserable face noah  is already known for being moody so  maybe it's all part of him trying to get  i